    metadataUri: 'ipfs://QmZ7ZDpGBmn5VUzBPErqLUG5dVRupEBFX65gkyEfDuahez',
    title: 'R0AR DAO Launch & Creation Timeline',
    description:
      "<p>The R0AR Token and R0AR xCHANGE are the centerpiece to our larger work with the R0AR ecosystem. From its very origin, we knew that it should be both a decentralized token and decentralized exchange. This Proposal locks in the road-map for the transition from centralized governance to decentralized governance and full community ownership.</p><p></p><p>Technical:</p><p>The R0AR Token from the beginning was designed to be the centerpiece for the function of the R0AR eco-system on the larger Ethereum Compatible family of blockchains. This eco-system includes the R0AR Token and R0AR xCHANGE which are decentralized in ownership and use. The R0AR Token will become more than a reward and will be the actual governance of these properties and their future.</p><p></p><p>Requirements:</p><p>Once 51% of R0AR Token ownership is achieved, the R0AR multi-sig Safe Treasury wallet will be upgraded into the R0AR DAO and it's Treasury. Voting and ownership rights will be revoked by the  multi-sig creator and development team addresses and will be transferred to the actual holders of R0AR Tokens. The DAO will be setup to record votes, proposals, DAO and Treasury management. The R0AR Token will be directly tied to the Treasury's assets.</p><p></p><p>Transition Steps:</p><p>Upon pre-sale completion, the R0AR Token's supply should be 40% distributed. At the time of this writing, it is over 1/3 of the way through this process already. 21%-24% is earmarked for rewards and function of the ecosystem. Once the amount of distributed tokens reaches 51%, FierceLabs' Wallets will transition the R0AR Wallet to the DAO function and the first Proposal will be deployed.</p><p></p><p>The following Properties listed under resources, will be under the governance of the R0AR community and thus, decentralized hopefully, for all time.</p>",
