    metadataUri: 'ipfs://QmVkYKi9zbFQGuoJeTUgvo9gC2Gsfjhjv3aMJk1MxfMRQZ',
    title: 'R0AR Vesting Schedule & Tokenomics Proposal ',
    description:
      '<p>The R0AR Token tokenomics are modeled after other projects in the Web 3 space with similar mechanics and similar function as our Phase 1 2024 Roadmapped projects. This includes the R0AR Token and R0AR xCHANGE. (Our Token is tied not just to these parts of the eco-system, but many more parts including our branded NFT project, R0AR Portal research and trading platform with AI and bot automation as well as many other parts mentioned on the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://FierceLabs.io">FierceLabs.io</a> website).<br><br><strong>Technical:</strong><br><br>R0AR Token is a 10 Billion Max Supply ERC-20 Token.<br>Utility is in Rewarding for R0AR eco-system including the R0AR xCHANGE &amp; use with the R0AR Portal.<br>Future added Utility upon true Token decentralization is governance for the R0AR DAO.<br>Token is no taxed on buy, sell or transfer (0 | 0 | 0).<br>Token Minting Rights are Revoked.<br><br><strong>Token Allocation:</strong><br><br>Pre-Sale - 40%<br>Eco-system &amp; Development - 24%<br>Liquidity &amp; Listing Reserves - 17%<br>Incentives - 5%<br>Team - 6.65%<br>Partners &amp; Advisors - 3.35%<br>Marketing Acquisition &amp; Partnerships - 4%<br><br><strong>Token Vesting:</strong><br><br>Pre-sale - is released / distributed upon close of pre-sale by pre-sale contract.<br><br>Team* - is released / distributed upon success of the community as a whole (The Team\'s success is tied to the System\'s success). 12 months 10%, 36 months final 90%.<br><br>Eco-system &amp; Development - These are released as needed for rewarding of the system. Slowly issued as lending pools require them.<br><br>Incentives* - Upon a future airdrop, Beginning after 6 months after exchange launch. (Rewards for activities and use of the system). These will be released and agreed to by future DAO vote.<br><br>Liquidity &amp; Listing Reserves* - Upon need by the community and DAO vote. <br><br>Partners &amp; Advisors* - 24 months<br><br>Marketing Acquisition &amp; Partnership* - 18 months<br><br><em>*All token Vesting will be locked into contract and distributed as needed at the Treasury wallet level by a proposal in the DAO level at the vesting schedule above upon successful vote once pre-sale is complete. (This proposal will be followed by the related proposals for each group once R0AR Tokens are placed in FL DAO Treasury and R0AR Safe Treasury (The Treasury of the future R0AR DAO).<br><br>**All unsold Pre-sale Tokens will be either burned, added to the eco-system, or added to the liquidity and listing reserve pools. The non-sale of these tokens will require another proposal in the FL DAO in order to decide whether these are burned or returned to the larger Treasury for the function of the system and liquidity of the Token.</em></p><p></p><p><em>The Platforms considered that are embedded in Gnosis Safe Wallets and can be combined with DAO functionality directly from the wallet, supporting FLDAO proposal #1 are llamapay and Sablier and will be decided on future DAO vote when Tokens are moved to the Treasury at the end of pre-sale lock. This vote and action (decision on platform for vesting payment &amp; tokens moved into locked contract) must be completed within 7 days of pre-sale end and will be final and no later than 7 days.</em></p>',
