    title: '12/31 Governance Guidance for End of Year Decentralization',
    description:
      '<p>As was discussed at the beginning of the DAO, we have distributed the tokens from the treasury to the decentralized member wallets. This first of two rounds was to take place by 12/31/2024 and they have been completed. Each wallet received 5,100,000 governance tokens for being early adopters and governance members which represented 1/99th of the whole. There will be a final distribution to all governance member wallets by 12/31/2025 (including those that received this drop). It will be for the remainder of the 372,500,000 FLDAO held by the DAO. It will be dropped either at the 90th member wallet added or 12/31/2025, whichever takes place first. Once this is triggered, the DAO will be completely community owned. We are excited for what this means for our early adopters as well as our oncoming DAO community members who choose to join us as we grow the R0AR ecosystem. This is a great day for our community. We are decentralizing more and more with the over 1100 wallets taking part in our entire ecosystem, this year, we expect so many more to join. We are heading to our new goal of 10,000+ community participant wallets in the R0AR ecosystem and 90 in our DAO. </p>',
