    title: 'FLDAO Token Airdrop Proposal',
    description:
      "<p>Upon creation, the FierceLabs.eth wallet became the largest holder of tokens in the FierceLabs DAO. 500 Million $FLDAO were created and given to the FierceLabs.eth wallet and are held there currently. This proposal will set an event in the future upon distribution of those tokens which will fully decentralize ownership to the larger community. </p><p></p><p>All holders of $FLDAO tokens who are members of the FierceLabs DAO will receive an equal share of the 500Million $FLDAO upon one of two events, whichever is the first.</p><p></p><p>Either upon the 90th wallet's membership or 12/31/2024. The snapshot will be taken upon one of these two events and once the snapshot is taken, the tokens will be set for distribution among those wallets, fully giving ownership away from FierceLabs and (FierceTek, LLC, the parent work) to the entire developer, governance and creative participating community.</p><p></p><p>This event will fully diversify ownership and governance of the FierceLabs properties and related IP, contracts and agreements.</p>",
